 Name: **Slowreel** (model line "SR-8 ambient tape studio"), because ambient music is tape running slowly and nothing is rushed.
 
-## Tokens (css/studio.css `:root`)
-- Surfaces: `--room #C9CECC` (the desk), `--chassis`, `--panel #EDEFED`, `--panel-hi #F7F8F7`, `--well`, lanes `--lane`/`--lane-alt`.
-- Ink: `--ink #15181A`, `--ink-2`, `--ink-3`, `--ink-4` (four steps, no pure black).
-- Glass: `--glass #1B2023`, `--glass-ink #EEF0EA`, `--glass-dim`.
-- Signal colours (keycaps, LEDs, knob arcs): `--signal #EC4E20` (play/record/export/peak), `--cobalt #2D55D2` (Space reverb,
-  focus ring), `--saffron #F2A900` (loop, Echo, song-cloud glow), `--leaf #2E9E6E` (on/saved).
-- Track colours: 8 inks in `sample-project.js` `TRACK_COLORS`; each track's colour runs through its head chip, clips, notes,
-  meter, mixer strip and keyboard.
+## Theme: Ink & lantern (dark)
+A temple courtyard at night. Everything you touch is sumi-ink lacquer and warm charcoal with the faintest washi-paper
+grain (an inline SVG noise, `--grain`); the only warm light comes from paper lanterns (`--lantern`, the "lit" keys and
+selected tabs are lantern paper with ink text) and vermilion lacquer (`--signal`: play head, record, export). Calm East
+Asian restraint: few accents, generous darkness, no pure black or white.
+
+## Tokens (css/studio.css `:root`, `color-scheme: dark`)
+- Surfaces: `--room #0B0A09` (the courtyard), `--chassis`, `--panel #181614`, `--panel-hi #201D1A`, `--well`, lanes `--lane`/`--lane-alt`.
+- Ink (washi ivory): `--ink #EFE6D4`, `--ink-2`, `--ink-3 #A39885` (5.8:1 on panels), `--ink-4 #8E8576` (4.5:1).
+- Glass: `--glass #080706`, `--glass-ink #F4EAD6`, `--glass-dim`.
+- Keys: `--key-top/--key-bot` (lacquer), `--paper-top/--paper-bot/--paper-ink` (lit lantern paper), `--verm-top/--verm-bot`.
+- Signal colours: `--signal #E5502E` vermilion, `--saffron #E9AE48` lantern gold, `--cobalt #8199DC` moon indigo (Space),
+  `--leaf #5FB088` pine; `--focus-c #F4CB78` is the focus ring (gold, 2px ink gap).
+- Track colours: saved projects keep the 8 colours in `sample-project.js` `TRACK_COLORS`; `controls.js trackInk()` draws each
+  as its lantern-lit pigment (lighter, slightly softer) so heads, clips, notes, steps and meters read on ink. Clip strips
+  and lit notes carry dark ink text (4.8:1 or better).
+- 3D deck (js/ui3d/scene3d.js): black-lacquer face lit by moonlight (cool key) with a hair-thin gold inlay; the niche is a
+  small night room lit by a paper-lantern pendant, with a moonlit temple roof and lanterns in its window.
 - Type: Archivo (wide-ish grotesk, 600-800 for names, uppercase tracked 10px labels) + IBM Plex Mono for every number.
   Fallbacks: Helvetica Neue / Arial and ui-monospace (Google Fonts are blocked in this container, so screenshots use fallbacks).
 - Space 4/8/12/16/24; radii key 7, panel 10, chassis 16. Key shadow is one top highlight + one bottom lip; pressed keys sink 1px.
